Hai!!

958
00:58:23,110 --> 00:58:23,910
Aku ke sana.

959
00:58:27,235 --> 00:58:28,235
Kau mau apa?

960
00:58:30,026 --> 00:58:31,568
Jadi, Dewa muncul di depanku...

961
00:58:31,818 --> 00:58:33,360
