- Kau gampang marah, Pak?
- Sangat menakutkan.

986
00:59:49,401 --> 00:59:50,740
Lompatlah selagi keretanya masih bergerak.

987
00:59:50,764 --> 00:59:51,901
Ini demi kebaikanmu sendiri.

988
00:59:54,193 --> 00:59:55,400
Apa, Bu Preethi?

989
00:59:55,401 --> 00:59:56,900
Kau terlalu mendewakan dia!

990
00:59:56,901 --> 00:59:57,755
Tunggu dan lihat saja, Botak!

991
01:00:01,276 --> 01:00:03,150
Kenapa kau duduk di sana
kaku dan sok jagoan?

992
01:00:03,151 --> 01:00:04,526
- Badan gym?
- Pak.

993
01:00:04,776 --> 01:00:06,485
